Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: bfd/coffgen.c
Line: 2988
Function: _bfd_coff_gc_mark_rsec
Bug type: out-of-bounds-read
CWE: CWE-125
Explanation: Uses cookie->rel->r_symndx from the input relocation to index cookie->sym_hashes without validating that r_symndx is within the symbol table bounds. A malformed relocation with a large r_symndx can index past the sym_hashes array, leading to an out-of-bounds read and potentially invalid pointer dereferences.

